Subject: [PATCH] Add Data.ByteString.Builder.Prim

---
 lib/Data/ByteString/Builder/Prim.hs | 112 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 lib/libs.cabal                      |   1 +
 2 files changed, 113 insertions(+)
